 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? And? Tent is well ventilated, and you open all sides as much as you can? Put them on a plate or a box, so sticks are off the ground bit. A strong fan in there with the tent open helps too. You' need strong fan for that, a draft will come in through any gap. Keep the tent open as much as you can. Let him hold the sticks while he's cooking. Put them in a box with his name on it. That or a picture of him holding them like bow in an archery box.",
